<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ doc_kind_label }} {{ doc_no }}</title>
<style>
/* ===========================================================================
   云枢 ERP 单据模板：采购订单 / 销售订单（PDF-02）
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   本文件由 PDF-01 的对账单模板（statement.html.tera）派生：**只改 .sheet 内部
   结构**，下面四条打印约束一个字都没动（缺一条就会踩坑）：

     ① @page 定死纸张与外边距 —— 不写会按 Chromium 默认 Letter 出纸；
     ② thead { display: table-header-group } —— 跨页时表头自动重复（验收②）；
     ③ tr / .no-break { break-inside: avoid } —— 单行 / 合计行 / 签字栏不被腰斩；
     ④ .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums } —— 金额数字等宽 + 右对齐，
        小数点逐位对齐。

   页码（「第 X 页 / 共 Y 页」）**不在本文件里**：`@page` 计数器在 Chromium 下
   不生效，HTML 里也拿不到总页数。页码由调用方通过 CDP 的 footerTemplate 输出
   （`pdf::template::order_footer`，用到 `.pageNumber` / `.totalPages` 两个
   Chromium 内建类），这样每一页都会印、且总页数是真实页数。

   字体族：必须首选 glyf(TrueType) 的静态 Noto Sans SC（见 PDF-01 证据：
   用 NotoSansCJK-*.ttc 时 Chromium 会退化成 Type3 字体，体积大 24 倍）。
   =========================================================================== */
@page {
  size: A4 portrait;
  margin: 12mm 10mm 16mm 10mm;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
  font-size: 10pt;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #1f2329;
  word-break: break-word;
}

/* ---------- 页眉（第 1 页顶部：公司名 + 单据标题） ---------- */
.sheet-header {
  border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #1f2329;
  padding-bottom: 4pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
.sheet-header .company {
  font-size: 12.5pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1pt;
}
.sheet-header .doc-title {
  font-size: 17pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: 8pt;
  margin: 4pt 0 6pt;
}

/* ---------- 单据头（单号 / 日期 / 状态 / 供应商(客户) / 仓库 / 经办人） ---------- */
table.head-fields {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
table.head-fields td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #c9cdd4;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.head-fields td.label {
  width: 62pt;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: #4e5969;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.head-fields td.value { width: auto; }

/* ---------- 明细表 ---------- */
table.detail {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
table.detail thead {
  /* ② 跨页重复表头 */
  display: table-header-group;
}
table.detail th,
table.detail td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 2.4pt 3.5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.detail th {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.detail tr {
  /* ③ 单行不跨页断裂 */
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
}
table.detail td.c-seq { text-align: center; width: 26pt; }
table.detail td.c-code { width: 62pt; }
table.detail td.c-name { width: auto; }
table.detail td.c-spec { width: 62pt; }
table.detail td.c-unit { text-align: center; width: 30pt; }
table.detail td.c-qty { width: 44pt; }
table.detail td.c-price { width: 58pt; }
table.detail td.c-amount { width: 70pt; }
table.detail td.c-remark { width: 56pt; color: #4e5969; }
table.detail td.c-code,
table.detail td.c-name,
table.detail td.c-spec,
table.detail td.c-remark {
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

/* 金额 / 数量：等宽数字 + 右对齐（等宽必须配右对齐，否则末位不齐） */
.num {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  font-feature-settings: "tnum" 1;
  text-align: right;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- 合计区（整块不跨页） ---------- */
.summary {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 8pt;
}
.summary table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
}
.summary table td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
}
.summary .label {
  width: 72pt;
  text-align: center;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.summary .value-cn { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; }

/* ---------- 签字栏（5 个空白手签位，整块不跨页） ---------- */
.sign {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 12pt;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8pt;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
.sign .box { flex: 1 1 0; }
.sign .cap { color: #4e5969; white-space: nowrap; }
.sign .line { margin-top: 16pt; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #4e5969; height: 1pt; }
.sign .date { margin-top: 3pt; color: #86909c; font-size: 8.5pt; }

.remark {
  margin-top: 9pt;
  font-size: 8.8pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.remark .tag { font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329; }

.footnote {
  margin-top: 5pt;
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  color: #86909c;
  text-align: right;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet-header">
  <div class="company">{{ company }}</div>
  <div class="doc-title">{{ doc_title }}</div>
</div>

<table class="head-fields">
{% for row in meta_rows %}
  <tr>
{% for field in row %}
    <td class="label">{{ field.label }}</td>
    <td class="value">{{ field.value }}</td>
{% endfor %}
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<table class="detail">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>#</th>
      <th>物料编码</th>
      <th>物料名称</th>
      <th>规格</th>
      <th>单位</th>
      <th>数量</th>
      <th>单价</th>
      <th>金额</th>
      <th>备注</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
{% for item in items %}
    <tr>
      <td class="c-seq">{{ item.seq }}</td>
      <td class="c-code">{{ item.material_code }}</td>
      <td class="c-name">{{ item.material_name }}</td>
      <td class="c-spec">{{ item.spec }}</td>
      <td class="c-unit">{{ item.unit }}</td>
      <td class="c-qty num">{{ item.qty }}</td>
      <td class="c-price num">{{ item.price }}</td>
      <td class="c-amount num">{{ item.amount }}</td>
      <td class="c-remark">{{ item.remark }}</td>
    </tr>
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="summary">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">行数合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:56pt">{{ row_count }}</td>
      <td class="label">数量合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:78pt">{{ total_qty }}</td>
      <td class="label">金额合计（{{ currency }}）</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:96pt">{{ total_amount }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">税额</td>
      <td class="num">{{ total_tax }}</td>
      <td class="label">价税合计</td>
      <td class="num value-cn">{{ total_with_tax }}</td>
      <td class="label">币种</td>
      <td class="num">{{ currency }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">价税合计（大写）</td>
      <td colspan="5" class="value-cn">{{ currency_cn }}{{ total_with_tax_cn }}（{{ currency_symbol }}{{ total_with_tax }}）</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="sign">
  <div class="box">
    <div class="cap">制单：</div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="date">日期：__________</div>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="cap">审核：</div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="date">日期：__________</div>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="cap">批准：</div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="date">日期：__________</div>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="cap">仓管：</div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="date">日期：__________</div>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="cap">客户签收：</div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="date">日期：__________</div>
  </div>
</div>

{% if remark %}
<div class="remark"><span class="tag">备注：</span>{{ remark }}</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="footnote">打印时间：{{ printed_at }}　本单据由云枢系统生成（{{ engine }}）</div>
</body>
</html>
